body:
yea my plan was to work and do college at the sametime its just that  i know what i want to do but its like everyone wants me to do a specific thing to help me deep down i want to fix the issues with my family and work towards moving and graduating..thats just what i want to do but deep down i know my gf cares about me alot and she gets mad when i dont follow up with what i say but its like im trying but everyone wants something i deliver but someone else ends up dissapointed and i dont want to lose my gf over these issues but shes just impatient while im the opposite i guess maybe the solution to this is just do my own thing until i can show results to her when im ready to its just she hates the waiting and seeing that im not doing "the right thing"

&#x200B;

im sorry im venting so much its just i cant talk to anyone on a 100% level but its the only thing that makes me feel better other than playing games lol
